# Example build-time environment for calendar. Copy to `.env` (which is
# git-ignored) and fill in as needed. All vars are optional — the app builds
# and runs without any of them. See `docs/configuration.md`.

# Dropbox app key (PKCE public client). Unset hides the Dropbox storage
# backend in Settings → Storage. Register an app at
# https://www.dropbox.com/developers/apps (scoped access, "App folder").
# VITE_DROPBOX_APP_KEY=

# Dropbox app-folder name (`Apps/<name>/`), fixed by your Dropbox app config.
# Only shown to the user (Settings → Storage) — the API's root is that folder.
# Defaults to "calendar".
# VITE_DROPBOX_APP_FOLDER=calendar

# Deploy base path — one per deployment slot, set by the Pages workflow:
# `/` (production), `/preview/` (main), `/branch/` (a parked feature branch).
# Default `/`. See docs/deployment.md.
# VITE_BASE=/

# The branch parked in the `/branch/` slot; surfaces in that build's label
# under Settings → Developer → Build. Set by the Pages workflow only.
# VITE_SOURCE_REF=
